codex
The screened fixture now commits SquadAttack and starts a bounded rush. It still fails to reach the assault line and consolidation. The trace exposed another constraint: the rifle group was required to have firing lines while taking cover, which pulled it off the screened approach. I’ve limited that requirement to the gun group and will report the remaining attack-chain failure.

